{"lesson": {"id": "resoudre_denominateurs_ppcm", "title": "Résoudre (3x − 2)/4 = (x + 6)/2 sans se mêler dans les dénominateurs", "language": "fr", "learning_goal": "Se débarrasser des dénominateurs en multipliant les deux côtés par le PPCM des dénominateurs."}, "math_context": {"symbols": {}, "expressions": {}}}
{"slice": {"slice_id": "s1_probleme_ppcm", "introduces": [{"id": "eq", "type": "math", "content": "\\dfrac{3x - 2}{4} = \\dfrac{x + 6}{2}"}, {"id": "lab_denom", "type": "label", "content": "dénominateurs : 4 et 2", "layout": {"next_to": "eq", "direction": "down", "gap": "md"}}, {"id": "lab_ppcm", "type": "label", "content": "PPCM = 4", "layout": {"next_to": "lab_denom", "direction": "down", "gap": "sm"}}, {"id": "eq_mult", "type": "math", "content": "4 \\times \\dfrac{3x - 2}{4} = 4 \\times \\dfrac{x + 6}{2}", "layout": {"next_to": "eq", "direction": "down", "gap": "lg"}}], "beats": [{"id": "b1", "say": "Ton équation, c'est trois x moins deux sur quatre, égale x plus six sur deux.", "cues": [{"id": "c_eq", "text": "trois x moins deux sur quatre"}], "do": [{"id": "w_eq", "verb": "write", "target": "eq", "at": "cue:c_eq"}]}, {"id": "b2", "say": "Les dénominateurs, c'est quatre et deux. Le plus petit commun multiple de quatre et deux, c'est quatre.", "cues": [{"id": "c_denom", "text": "dénominateurs"}, {"id": "c_ppcm", "text": "plus petit commun multiple"}], "do": [{"id": "s_denom", "verb": "show", "target": "lab_denom", "at": "cue:c_denom"}, {"id": "s_ppcm", "verb": "show", "target": "lab_ppcm", "at": "cue:c_ppcm"}]}, {"id": "b3", "say": "L'idée, c'est de multiplier les deux côtés par quatre. Les dénominateurs vont disparaître d'un coup.", "cues": [{"id": "c_mult", "text": "multiplier les deux côtés par quatre"}], "do": [{"id": "w_eqmult", "verb": "write", "target": "eq_mult", "at": "cue:c_mult"}]}]}}
{"slice": {"slice_id": "s2_gauche", "introduces": [{"id": "gauche", "type": "math", "content": "3x - 2", "layout": {"next_to": "eq_mult", "direction": "down", "gap": "md"}}], "beats": [{"id": "b4", "say": "À gauche, quatre sur quatre, ça fait un. Il reste juste trois x moins deux.", "cues": [{"id": "c_quatre_quatre", "text": "quatre sur quatre"}, {"id": "c_reste", "text": "trois x moins deux"}], "do": [{"id": "t_gauche", "verb": "transform", "source": "eq_mult", "target": "gauche", "at": "cue:c_quatre_quatre"}, {"id": "h_gauche", "verb": "highlight", "target": "gauche", "role": "result", "at": "after:t_gauche"}]}, {"id": "b5", "say": "Regarde bien : le dénominateur quatre est parti, pas de fraction à traîner.", "cues": [{"id": "c_denom4", "text": "dénominateur quatre"}], "do": [{"id": "h_gauche2", "verb": "highlight", "target": "gauche", "role": "accent", "start": "cue:c_denom4", "end": "cue_end:c_denom4"}]}]}}
{"slice": {"slice_id": "s3_droite", "introduces": [{"id": "droite1", "type": "math", "content": "4 \\times \\dfrac{x + 6}{2} = 2 \\times (x + 6)", "layout": {"next_to": "gauche", "direction": "down", "gap": "md"}}, {"id": "droite2", "type": "math", "content": "2(x + 6) = 2x + 12", "layout": {"next_to": "droite1", "direction": "down", "gap": "md"}}], "beats": [{"id": "b6", "say": "À droite, quatre fois x plus six sur deux. Quatre divisé par deux, ça fait deux.", "cues": [{"id": "c_droite", "text": "quatre fois x plus six sur deux"}, {"id": "c_deux", "text": "ça fait deux"}], "do": [{"id": "w_droite1", "verb": "write", "target": "droite1", "at": "cue:c_droite"}, {"id": "h_droite1", "verb": "highlight", "target": "droite1", "role": "result", "at": "cue:c_deux"}]}, {"id": "b7", "say": "Donc deux fois la parenthèse x plus six. Je distribue : deux x plus douze.", "cues": [{"id": "c_paren", "text": "deux fois la parenthèse x plus six"}, {"id": "c_distrib", "text": "deux x plus douze"}], "do": [{"id": "w_droite2", "verb": "write", "target": "droite2", "at": "cue:c_paren"}, {"id": "h_droite2", "verb": "highlight", "target": "droite2", "role": "accent", "start": "cue:c_distrib", "end": "cue_end:c_distrib"}]}]}}
{"slice": {"slice_id": "s4_resoudre", "introduces": [{"id": "eq_simple", "type": "math", "content": "3x - 2 = 2x + 12", "layout": {"next_to": "droite2", "direction": "down", "gap": "lg"}}, {"id": "eq_soust", "type": "math", "content": "3x - 2x - 2 = 2x - 2x + 12", "layout": {"next_to": "eq_simple", "direction": "down", "gap": "md"}}, {"id": "eq_xmoins2", "type": "math", "content": "x - 2 = 12", "layout": {"next_to": "eq_soust", "direction": "down", "gap": "md"}}, {"id": "eq_ajout", "type": "math", "content": "x - 2 + 2 = 12 + 2", "layout": {"next_to": "eq_xmoins2", "direction": "down", "gap": "md"}}, {"id": "sol", "type": "math", "content": "x = 14", "layout": {"next_to": "eq_ajout", "direction": "down", "gap": "md"}, "style": {"role": "result"}}, {"id": "verif_g", "type": "math", "content": "\\dfrac{3(14) - 2}{4} = \\dfrac{40}{4} = 10", "layout": {"next_to": "sol", "direction": "down", "gap": "lg"}}, {"id": "verif_d", "type": "math", "content": "\\dfrac{14 + 6}{2} = \\dfrac{20}{2} = 10", "layout": {"next_to": "verif_g", "direction": "down", "gap": "sm"}}], "beats": [{"id": "b8", "say": "Maintenant j'ai trois x moins deux égale deux x plus douze. Je regroupe les x à gauche.", "cues": [{"id": "c_simple", "text": "trois x moins deux égale deux x plus douze"}, {"id": "c_regroupe", "text": "regroupe les x à gauche"}], "do": [{"id": "w_simple", "verb": "write", "target": "eq_simple", "at": "cue:c_simple"}, {"id": "w_soust", "verb": "write", "target": "eq_soust", "at": "cue:c_regroupe"}]}, {"id": "b9", "say": "Ça donne x moins deux égale douze. J'ajoute deux des deux côtés : x égale quatorze.", "cues": [{"id": "c_xmoins2", "text": "x moins deux égale douze"}, {"id": "c_ajoute", "text": "ajoute deux des deux côtés"}, {"id": "c_sol", "text": "x égale quatorze"}], "do": [{"id": "w_xmoins2", "verb": "write", "target": "eq_xmoins2", "at": "cue:c_xmoins2"}, {"id": "w_ajout", "verb": "write", "target": "eq_ajout", "at": "cue:c_ajoute"}, {"id": "w_sol", "verb": "write", "target": "sol", "at": "cue:c_sol"}]}, {"id": "b10", "say": "Vérifions dans l'équation de départ. À gauche : trois fois quatorze moins deux sur quatre, ça fait quarante sur quatre, donc dix. À droite : quatorze plus six sur deux, ça fait vingt sur deux, donc dix. Les deux côtés sont égaux.", "cues": [{"id": "c_vg", "text": "À gauche"}, {"id": "c_vd", "text": "À droite"}], "do": [{"id": "w_vg", "verb": "write", "target": "verif_g", "at": "cue:c_vg"}, {"id": "w_vd", "verb": "write", "target": "verif_d", "at": "cue:c_vd"}, {"id": "f_eq_simple", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "eq_simple", "at": "cue:c_vg"}, {"id": "f_eq_soust", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "eq_soust", "at": "cue:c_vg"}, {"id": "f_eq_xmoins2", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "eq_xmoins2", "at": "cue:c_vg"}, {"id": "f_eq_ajout", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "eq_ajout", "at": "cue:c_vg"}, {"id": "f_gauche", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "gauche", "at": "cue:c_vg"}, {"id": "f_droite1", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "droite1", "at": "cue:c_vg"}, {"id": "f_droite2", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "droite2", "at": "cue:c_vg"}, {"id": "f_eq_mult", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "eq_mult", "at": "cue:c_vg"}, {"id": "f_lab_denom", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "lab_denom", "at": "cue:c_vg"}], "pause_after": "long"}]}}
{"slice": {"slice_id": "s5_recap", "introduces": [{"id": "regle", "type": "callout", "content": "Multiplier par le PPCM", "layout": {"next_to": "eq", "direction": "down", "gap": "lg"}}], "beats": [{"id": "b11", "say": "Pour ne plus te mêler dans les dénominateurs, tu multiplies les deux côtés par le PPCM, ici quatre. Les fractions s'éliminent, et tu résous tranquillement. Ta solution, c'est x égale quatorze.", "cues": [{"id": "c_ppcm", "text": "PPCM"}, {"id": "c_fractions", "text": "fractions s'éliminent"}, {"id": "c_solution", "text": "x égale quatorze"}], "do": [{"id": "s_regle", "verb": "show", "target": "regle", "at": "cue:c_ppcm"}, {"id": "h_ppcm", "verb": "highlight", "target": "lab_ppcm", "role": "accent", "start": "cue:c_ppcm", "end": "cue_end:c_ppcm"}, {"id": "h_sol", "verb": "highlight", "target": "sol", "role": "result", "start": "cue:c_solution", "end": "cue_end:c_solution"}, {"id": "f_verif_g", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "verif_g", "at": "cue:c_solution"}, {"id": "f_verif_d", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "verif_d", "at": "cue:c_solution"}]}]}}
